<section class="zero-add" id="zero-add" style="background: url('{{ 'slide6_img0_26.png' | asset_url }}') center/cover no-repeat;">
  <div class="container">
    <h2 class="section-title" style="color:#fff;">5大0添加，给头皮最纯净的呵护</h2>
    <div class="zero-grid">
      <div class="zero-card">
        <div class="zero-icon"><i class="fas fa-ban"></i></div>
        <h3>0硅油</h3>
        <p>告别发丝假滑感，让头皮毛囊自由呼吸，回归自然状态。</p>
      </div>
      <div class="zero-card">
        <div class="zero-icon"><i class="fas fa-leaf"></i></div>
        <h3>0月桂醇</h3>
        <p>避免过度清洁破坏皮脂膜，建立健康的头皮天然保护屏障。</p>
      </div>
      <div class="zero-card">
        <div class="zero-icon"><i class="fas fa-flask"></i></div>
        <h3>0防腐剂</h3>
        <p>拒绝添加任何化学防腐剂，从源头降低致敏风险，使用更安心。</p>
      </div>
      <div class="zero-card">
        <div class="zero-icon"><i class="fas fa-shield-virus"></i></div>
        <h3>0硫酸盐</h3>
        <p>摒弃强刺激清洁成分，配方温和亲肤，敏感肌也能放心用。</p>
      </div>
      <div class="zero-card">
        <div class="zero-icon"><i class="fas fa-spray-can-sparkles"></i></div>
        <h3>0人工香精</h3>
        <p>只保留植物草本萃取的自然清香，无人工合成香料的刺鼻感。</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
.zero-add { padding: 100px 0; position: relative; }
.zero-add::before {
  content: ''; position: absolute; inset: 0;
  background: rgba(0,0,0,0.55); z-index: 1;
}
.zero-add .container { position: relative; z-index: 2; }
.zero-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr));
  gap: 24px;
  margin-top: 40px;
}
.zero-card {
  background: white;
  border-radius: 16px;
  padding: 32px 24px;
  text-align: center;
  box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.06);
  transition: transform 0.3s;
}
.zero-card:hover { transform: translateY(-4px); }
.zero-icon {
  width: 64px; height: 64px;
  margin: 0 auto 16px;
  background: #4a7c3f;
  border-radius: 50%;
  display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
  color: white; font-size: 24px;
}
.zero-card h3 { font-size: 18px; margin-bottom: 12px; color: var(--brand-dark); }
.zero-card p { font-size: var(--body-small); color: var(--text-secondary); line-height: 1.6; }
</style>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Zero Additives",
  "settings": [],
  "presets": [{ "name": "Zero Additives" }]
}
{% endschema %}
